      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. we're trying to get the backup unit running now but it keeps cutting out. one minute it's fine, then it just stalls or loses power for no reason. it's super frustrating because there hasn't been any maintenance issues or obvious damage. any idea why a machine would just start acting up like this all of a sudden?",
