      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, it's just so weird. everything looked fine this morning and now it's like the machine is fighting us. it's almost like something is intentionally messing with the controls or causing these tiny, unpredictable glitches. is there any other reason for this kind of spontaneous, weird failure besides just bad parts?",
